      "id": "claim_a63d5a6081f54a909e0b9901ff4f8b8a",
      "statement": "Root commands: pnpm build is vp run -r --cache build (type-check plus codegen in dependency order with task-cache replay), pnpm test runs the root node --test suite then per-package cached test tasks, and pnpm lint:check is vp lint with the ruleset in vite.config.ts (correctness/suspicious as errors, type-aware linting intentionally off because RPC promise pipelining deliberately leaves promises unawaited, a custom gadgets/prefer-jsdoc rule, and browser/worker scope overrides).",
